# Applies to builds whose context is the repo root (Dockerfile.product,
# Dockerfile.gateway). The WhatsApp engine builds from ./backend and is
# unaffected.
#
# Keeps secrets (.env) out of the build context entirely, and stops a host
# node_modules / dist from being copied over the ones built in the image.
.git
.env
.env.*
**/node_modules
frontend/dist
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
backend/.venv
